        "Pauline Jani (akazvarwa 10 Chikunguru 1989 – akashayikwa 11 Gumiguru 2023) aive mutambi wenetibhora wechidhidhizha weZimbabwe, uye aitamba pazvinzvimbo zvemurindachiwiro (goal keeper) uye munyudzabhora (goal shooter). Akazvarwa mugore ra1989 kuHippo Valley Estate, uye achiri mupenyu aive chikamu chechikwata cheZimbabwe vakapedza pachinzvimbo chechisere muMukombe weNetibhora wePasirose wa2019, zvaive chimaka chenhoroondo pakuwanikwa kweZimbabwe kwekutanga mumutambo weMukumbo weNetibhora wePasirose. Akareva nhau dzekutana kutamva spoti yenetibhora ari zera rechemakumimatatu mushure mekutamba mumutambo wekupedzisira weZimbabwe payaikwikwidza ne Vuganda kuMukombe wePasirose we2019.",
